Today I go to the government office.
This is the FRRO office.
I do my registration here.
I see an official.
I go near him.
"Namaste sir," I say.
"Namaste," he says.
"Where are your documents?" he asks.
"I have all the documents," I say.
I give the documents.
He looks at the documents.
"What is your age?" he asks.
"My age is thirty-one years," I say.
"Good, what is your new mobile number?" he asks.
"My mobile number is nine eight seven six five, four three two one zero," I say.
He writes the number on the computer.
"Your registration is complete," he says.
"Thank you, sir," I say.
Now all my work is complete.
I am very happy.
